ore | [Tool C] | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Platform Support | [%] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] |\n| Ease of Use | [%] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] |\n| CI/CD Integration | [%] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] |\n| Scalability | [%] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] |\n| Reporting | [%] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] |\n| Community and Support | [%] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] |\n| Cost | [%] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] |\n| Maintenance Overhead | [%] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] | [Evidence] | [1-5] |\n| WEIGHTED TOTAL | 100% | | [Score] | | [Score] | | [Score] |\n\nScoring: 1 = Poor | 2 = Below Average | 3 = Acceptable | 4 = Good | 5 = Excellent\n\n---\n\n4. PROOF OF CONCEPT ASSESSMENT:\nRecommended PoC Tool: [Tool with highest weighted score]\nPoC Duration: [e.g., 1 week | 2 sprints]\n\nPoC Validation Checklist:\n| Item | What to Validate | Pass Criteria | Result |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Platform support | Run test on iOS + Android device | Both execute without errors | [Pending] |\n| CI integration | Trigger test run from CI pipeline | Tests execute on PR trigger | [Pending] |\n| Reporting | Generate test report after run | Report contains pass/fail + screenshots | [Pending] |\n| Parallel execution | Run 3 tests in parallel | No conflicts, correct results | [Pending] |\n| [Additional item] | [What to validate] | [Pass criteria] | [Pending] |\n\n---\n\n5. TOTAL COST OF OWNERSHIP (Annual):\n| Cost Item | [Tool A] | [Tool B] | [Tool C] |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Licensing | [Cost] | [Cost] | [Cost] |\n| Infrastructure | [Cost] | [Cost] | [Cost] |\n| Training | [Cost] | [Cost] | [Cost] |\n| Maintenance (person-days/yr) | [Days] | [Days] | [Days] |\n| TOTAL ANNUAL COST | [Total] | [Total] | [Total] |\n\n---\n\n6. M