-0.3px] | [Hex] |\n| [e.g., Body text] | [Font] | [Size] | [Weight] | [Line height] | [Spacing] | [Hex] |\n| [e.g., Caption] | [Font] | [Size] | [Weight] | [Line height] | [Spacing] | [Hex] |\n\nText truncation rules:\n| Element | Max lines | Truncation | Behaviour |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [Element] | [N] | Ellipsis end | [e.g., Tooltip on hover showing full text] |\n\n---\n\n4. COLOUR:\n| Element | State | Fill Colour | Opacity | Stroke Colour |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [e.g., Primary button] | Default | #[Hex] | 100% | None |\n| [e.g., Primary button] | Hover | #[Hex] | 100% | None |\n| [e.g., Primary button] | Pressed | #[Hex] | 100% | None |\n| [e.g., Primary button] | Disabled | #[Hex] | 40% | None |\n| [e.g., Background] | — | #[Hex] | 100% | — |\n| [e.g., Divider] | — | #[Hex] | 20% | — |\n\nDark mode values:\n| Element | Light mode | Dark mode |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Element] | #[Hex] | #[Hex] |\n\n---\n\n5. STATES:\n| State | Trigger | Visual Change | Duration |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Default | On load | [Description] | — |\n| Hover | Mouse over (Web only) | [e.g., Background: #Hex, cursor: pointer] | 150ms |\n| Pressed / Active | Tap or click | [e.g., Background: #Hex, scale: 0.97] | 100ms |\n| Focused | Keyboard focus | [e.g., 2px solid #Hex outline, offset 2px] | — |\n| Disabled | Prop: disabled=true | [e.g., Opacity 40%, cursor: not-allowed] | — |\n| Loading | Async action triggered | [e.g., Spinner replaces label] | — |\n| Error | Validation failure | [e.g., Border: #ErrorHex, error message below] | — |\n| Empty | No data | [e.g., Empty state illustration + copy] | — |\n| Success | Action completed | [e.g., Checkmark animation + success message] | 300ms |\n\n---\n\n6. INTERACTION AND ANIMATION:\n| Interaction | Trigger | Animation | Duration | Easing |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [e.g., Modal open] | Button tap | Fade in + slide up | 300ms | ease-out |\n| [e.g., Page transition] | Navigation | Slide left | 250ms | ease-in-out |\n| [e.g., Button press] | Tap | Scale 0.97 | 100ms | ease-in |\n| [e.g., Toast notification] | Action success | Slide down from top | 200ms | ease-out |\n\nGesture support (Mobile):\n| Gesture | Action | Threshold |\n|---|---|---|\n| [e.g., Swipe left] | [e.g., Delete item] | [e.g., 50% of item width] |\n| [e.g., Pull to refresh] | [e.g., Refresh list] | [e.g., 80pt drag distance] |\n\n---\n\n7. RESPONSIVE BEHAVIOUR:\n| Breakpoint | Width | Layout Change | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Mobile | < 768px | [e.g., Single column, stacked CTA] | [Notes] |\n| Tablet | 768px–1024px | [e.g., Two column, side-by-side CTA] | [Notes] |\n| Desktop | > 1024px | [e.g., Three column, inline CTA] | [Notes] |\n\nElements that hide/show per breakpoint:\n| Element | Mobile | Tablet | Desktop |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [Element] | Show/Hide | Show/Hide | Show/Hide |\n\n---\n\n8. PLATFORM-SPECIFIC NOTES:\n| Spec Item | iOS | Android | Web |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Navigation pattern | [e.g., Back button top-left] | [e.g., System back gesture] | [e.g., Breadcrumb] |\n| Font | [e.g., SF Pro] | [e.g., Roboto] | [e.g., Inter] |\n| Touch target minimum | 44x44pt | 48x48dp | 44x44px |\n| Status bar | [e.g., Light content] | [e.g., Dark content] | N/A |\n| Safe area | [e.g., Respect bottom safe area] | [e.g., Edge-to-edge] | N/A |\n\n---\n\n9. ACCESSIBILITY REQUIREMENTS:\n| Element | ARIA Role | ARIA Label | Contrast Ratio | Touch Target | Keyboard Focusable |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [e.g., CTA button] | button | [e.g., "Submit form"] | [e.g., 4.6:1 ✅ AA] | 44x44pt | Yes |\n| [e.g., Icon] | img | [e.g., "Search"] | N/A | 44x44pt | No |\n| [e.g., Input field] | textbox | [e.g., "Email address"] | [e.g., 5.2:1 ✅ AA] | 44x44pt | Yes |\n\nScreen reader behaviour:\n  - Focus order: [e.g., "1. Title → 2. Description → 3. Primary CTA → 4. Secondary CTA"]\n  - Announcements: [e.g., "On form submit error: announce error message via aria-live region"]\n\n---\n\n10. CONTENT AND COPY:\n| Element | Copy | Character limit | Empty state