ex on updated_at] | [e.g., 4x faster] |\n| [e.g., Slow transformation] | [e.g., Row-by-row processing] | [e.g., Vectorised Pandas / Spark] | [e.g., 10x faster] |\n| [e.g., Slow load] | [e.g., Single-threaded insert] | [e.g., Bulk COPY + partitioning] | [e.g., 6x faster] |\n\nParallelism strategy: [e.g., Partition source by date range and process N partitions in parallel]\nCaching strategy: [e.g., Cache reference/lookup tables in memory for join operations]\nEstimated throughput: [e.g., ~2M rows/min with current configuration]\n\n---\n\n10. SECURITY AND COMPLIANCE:\n| Requirement | Implementation | Owner |\n|---|---|---|\n| Credentials management | [e.g., AWS Secrets Manager | Vault | Env vars] | [Team] |\n| Data encryption in transit | TLS 1.2+ on all connections | [Team] |\n| Data encryption at rest | [e.g., AES-256 on S3 | Snowflake default encryption] | [Team] |\n| PII masking | [e.g., Hash with SHA-256 | Tokenisation] | [Team] |\n| Access control | [e.g., IAM roles | Column-level security | Row-level security] | [Team] |\n| Audit logging | [e.g., All pipeline runs logged with user, timestamp, row counts] | [Team] |\n| Data retention | [e.g., Raw data deleted after 90 days per policy] | [Team] |\n| Compliance standard | [e.g., GDPR | PDPA | SOC 2 | HIPAA | None] | [Team] |
